        <div class="accordion accordion-flush faq-accordion" id="faqContact">
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq1">How long does it take to get started?</button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqContact">
              <div class="accordion-body">You can easily start your free trial. Yes, just sign up! No credit card is required. The basic setup takes around 10 to 20 minutes. In case of gaushala or enterprise plans, we provide onboarding support within 24 hours of your inquiry.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq2">Is the free trial plan by BoviNetra really free? What’s included?</button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqContact">
              <div class="accordion-body">Yes, the free trial plan by BoviNetra is completely free. Enjoy the core features for 14 days, including milk entry, farmer management, delivery management, and basic analytics. No hidden or surprise charges. If you choose to continue, then only you have to pay.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq3">Do you offer on-site visits or training?</button>
            </h2>
            <div id="fq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqContact">
              <div class="accordion-body">Yes, for customers with the enterprise and gaushala management plan, we offer on-site setup and training at your bovin or gaushala. Connect with our sales team to get a quote.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fq4">I would like to become a partner or a reseller. Whom shall I contact?</button>
